editor_description = "Training facility body (TrainingResearch.make_body → FacilityView %BodySlot, full rect): the facility's research rows as TrainingResearchCard cards, 3 columns, scrolling inside %Scroll (about 4.5 rows on a 1080×1920 screen). Thumbnail tap = the course info popover (%Info, outside the scroll, closed by %InfoCatcher). Bottom bar action = owned courses modal (TrainingResearchOwned)."
